    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροκύς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύδος</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			) <i>flock</i> or <i>nap on woollen cloth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Fug.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>piece of wool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
